NOTE: (Peters et al., JCTC 2010, doi:10.1021/ct1002917). The original zinc_zaff.frcmod
NOTE: was not recoverable from the compute instance. Acceptance rests on the measured
NOTE: Zn-S distance against the crystallographic band (0.2388 nm vs 0.226-0.236 nm)
NOTE: and the same-seed three-model comparison (see results/zn_model_selection.md),
NOTE: not on provenance. Source of values: the circulating ZAFF parameter set;
NOTE: bond length r0 sits at the midpoint of the template-measured range.
